<title>USA: Intelligent Medical gets FDA approval.</title>
<headline>Intelligent Medical gets FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelligent Medical Imaging Inc said on Friday it has received Food and Drug Administration approval for its MICRO21 microscope system to perform an additional procedure.</p>
<p>The automated microscope system can now be used for nDNA analysis to help detect systemic rheumatic diseases.</p>
<p>The company also said the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office has approved its design for an improved medical slide holder for the MICRO21 system.</p>
</text>
